  <trk>
    <name>LF7_LF13_around_Eindhoven</name>
    <desc>Notes: LF13 is north an east, LF7 is south and west. Alongside canal, west of 83 official route has crappy roads, consider using the other side of the canal. In general: 13 is much better if you don't need to be in EIndhoven itself</desc>
    <url>/user/OliverH/traces/1324941</url>
